--- !u!114 &-6124407356527343084
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: CL_V.1/6
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Estoy seguro de que el mercader sab\xEDa que algo estaba mal con aquel colgante./nCelebr\xF3
    tras deshacerse de \xE9l./nPodr\xEDa ser ese el amuleto que acab\xF3 con la vida
    del hijo del molinero."
  childrenIDs:
  - CL_V.1/7
  - CL_V.1/8
  - 7
  - 8
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1084
    y: 127
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: -8428083734279256767, guid: 798d6f6afe3d7fd4ba028b9553338ac4, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &-4637506094358042446
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: CL_V.1/11
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Yo sab\xEDa que el colgante era peligroso./nPero estaba aterrorizado por
    lo que podr\xEDa pasarme./nSent\xED como si, hablaba de \xE9l, el colgante me
    har\xEDa da\xF1o./nNo puedo evitar pensar que yo mismo soy responsable de la
    muerte del chico."
  childrenIDs:
  - CL_V.1/12
  - CL_V.1/13
  - CL_V.1/14
  - CL_V.1/15
  - 12
  - 13
  - 14
  - 15
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2192
    y: 135
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 7842016779124046565, guid: 798d6f6afe3d7fd4ba028b9553338ac4, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &-4395317018739754460
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: CL_V.1/4
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "S\xED. Sin duda, uno de ellos se trataba de \xC9dgar, el comerciante./nLa
    otra era una mujer./nNo pude verle el rostro.../nPero la vi entrar en la posada
    Garrido."
  childrenIDs:
  - CL_V.1/6
  - 6
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 693
    y: 1
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 7274682276740212368, guid: 798d6f6afe3d7fd4ba028b9553338ac4, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &-3700958590071576319
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: CL_V.1/7
  isPlayerSpeaking: 1
  text: "\xBFQu\xE9 pudes decirme de \xC9dgar?"
  childrenIDs:
  - CL_V.1/9
  - 9
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1440
    y: -8
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
